                                "sense_id": "9e3b18bf-aa5f-3f36-a278-c7e412f86431",
                                "text": "They also liked the young gentlemen and wished them happy lives. So we ambled on, feeling ecstactically how casual, amiable, and goodwilled the world in the market is. They work hard there."
