                                "sense_id": "9e3b18bf-aa5f-3f36-a278-c7e412f86431",
                                "text": "She just did – A pause then, thoughtful, bemused, but goodwilled. The medical staff were obviously pleased for Alice, but something more was affecting them. Her quiet serenity was infectious."
